EXPERIMENT 3 – CI/CD Pipeline using Python, GitHub Actions and Docker Hub
Objective: To implement a CI/CD pipeline that tests, containerizes, and deploys a Python application to Docker Hub using GitHub Actions.

Below is the complete procedure from the beginning, including the websites visited, files created, commands executed, and final verification.

I've used your actual GitHub repository name: python-ci-docker-app.

Complete lab record – Step-by-step
